   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine, TB/HIV, United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF)This program has the following goals: Ensuring uninterrupted supply of necessary commodities/medications/diagnostics for pupulations in need. The objectives of this program are: Delivery of necessary quality assured medication/commodities/diagnostics for treatment and prevention to National HIV program.  Delivery of necessary quality assured medication/commodities/diagnostics to National TB program</narrative>
